[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7740.47, "timestamp": "02:09:00", "text": "你知道吗，我对所看到的东西产生了兴趣，这在某种程度上影响了我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7742.149, "timestamp": "02:09:02", "text": "。 我本来想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7746.709, "timestamp": "02:09:06", "text": "打“没有耶和华见证人行走”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7750.31, "timestamp": "02:09:10", "text": "这里还有更多这样的照片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7752.55, "timestamp": "02:09:12", "text": "更多内容请点击此处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7764.95, "timestamp": "02:09:24", "text": "我觉得自己好像是唯一一个四处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7767.27, "timestamp": "02:09:27", "text": "游荡、记录一切的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7769.27, "timestamp": "02:09:29", "text": "即使活动结束后，大家都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7771.669, "timestamp": "02:09:31", "text": "收拾好东西离开了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7773.83, "timestamp": "02:09:33", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7782.39, "timestamp": "02:09:42", "text": "这里一个人也没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7784.79, "timestamp": "02:09:44", "text": "大家收拾好东西就离开了。 我们一整年都看到了这种情况"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7787.99, "timestamp": "02:09:47", "text": "。 你们还记得吗？ 我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7790.31, "timestamp": "02:09:50", "text": "一整年都看到了这种情况。 我这已经是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7794.47, "timestamp": "02:09:54", "text": "第三次来这里了。   是的"}]